happy birthday kate middleton  kensington palace released three  timeless regal and stunning photographs  of the duchess of cambridge on saturday  ahead of her 40th birthday on sunday  [Music]  according to the palace the portraits  were taken in november at kew gardens by  photographer paolo reversi the photos  will become part of the collection of  the national portrait gallery which is  set to reopen in  2023 communities across the uk will have  the opportunity to view the stunning  photographs in person as they will be  featured in the gallery's coming home  project which the palace dubbed as quote  a nationwide initiative which sees  portraits of well-known individuals  being sent to locations which they are  closely associated with that's really  what matters to me kate who was shown in  the portraits wearing jewelry that once  belonged to princess diana chose three  meaningful locations where she would  like her photos to appear berkshire in  south england st andrews in scotland and  anglesey an island off the coast of  wells it is a milestone birthday it's an  important birthday and when it comes to  how the duchess of cambridge is  celebrating the big 40 royal expert  katie nicholl tells e.t she thinks the  celebration will be pretty low-key and  might even include kate baking her own  cake i think there will be a celebration  but i think it will be  a celebration for family and for close  friends and there was talk of a of a big  party which has apparently been  downscaled because of covenant because  of the restrictions  but i suspect um that that kate is  probably happier having something a  little bit more low-key she had a big  21st birthday um but i think that was  the last big birthday that she really  really celebrated i know that williams  sometimes gets in the kitchen but really  kate kate is the master chef and she's  also brilliant at baking cakes so i  wouldn't be at all surprised if she  bakes her own birthday cake cakes have  always been a big tradition  in the middleton family kate has  revealed how on the nights before her  children's birthdays she's often up late  into the night and posting the final  touches to a birthday cake so i can't  imagine it'll be a shockboard cake for  kate i'm sure she'll be making it  herself  [Music]
 

